{"title": "Food regulator issues notices to Swiggy Instamart over expired and spoiled products", "summary": "The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) has issued notices to Swiggy Instamart for allegedly delivering expired and spoiled food products. This move comes amid growing concerns over food safety in the country's rapidly expanding e-commerce market.", "summary_points": ["The FSSAI has issued 9 notices to Swiggy Instamart over alleged food safety violations.", "The regulator is investigating complaints of expired and spoiled products being delivered by Swiggy Instamart.", "Swiggy Instamart has clarified that the FSSAI order was related to licence updates, not food safety issues.", "The incident highlights the need for stricter regulations in the e-commerce sector to ensure food safety.", "This is not an isolated incident, with several other companies facing similar complaints and regulatory actions."], "title_hi": "फूड सेफ्टी एथॉरिटी ने स्विग्गी इंस्टामार्ट पर अलर्ट जारी किया", "summary_hi": "फूड सेफ्टी एथॉरिटी ने स्विग्गी इंस्टामार्ट पर अलर्ट जारी किया है, जिसमें खाद्य उत्पादों में गड़बड़ी और खराबतों की शिकायतों पर ध्यान दिया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["फूड सेफ्टी एथॉरिटी ने स्विग्गी इंस्टामार्ट पर 9 नोटिस जारी किए हैं.", "नियामक एजेंसी खाद्य उत्पादों में गड़बड़ी और खराबतों की शिकायतों पर ध्यान दे रही है।", "स्विग्गी इंस्टामार्ट ने बताया है कि फूड सेफ्टी एथॉरिटी का आदेश लाइसेंस अपडेट्स से संबंधित था, न कि खाद्य सुरक्षा मुद्दों से।", "यह घटना खाद्य सुरक्षा में सख्त नियमों की आवश्यकता को उजागर करती है।", "यह एक अकेली घटना नहीं है, कई अन्य कंपनियों को भी समान शिकायतों और नियामक कार्रवाइयों का सामना करना पड़ा है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the severity of the issue, highlighting the potential health risks associated with expired and spoiled food products. They also mention that this is not an isolated incident, but rather a pattern of behavior by Swiggy Instamart."], "center": ["Centrist coverage frames the story as a regulatory issue, focusing on the FSSAI's actions and Swiggy Instamart's response. They do not emphasize the potential health risks or suggest that this is part of a larger pattern."], "right": ["Right-leaning outlets focus on the regulatory overreach by the FSSAI, suggesting that the agency is targeting small businesses unfairly. They also downplay the severity of the issue and its potential impact on public health."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["वामपंथी समाचार एजेंसियां इस मुद्दे को गंभीरता से लेती हैं, खाद्य उत्पादों में गड़बड़ी और खराबतों के स्वास्थ्य जोखिमों को उजागर करती हैं।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132326250,imgsize-88108.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/fssai-issues-9-notices-to-e-commerce-app-for-alleged-food-safety-violations/articleshow/132326163.cms", "headline": "FSSAI issues 9 notices to e-commerce app for alleged food safety violations"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/swiggy-instamart-gets-9-fssai-notices-over-contaminated-eggs-milk-spoilt-kakke-da-paratha-other-complaints-11783755816326.html", "headline": "Swiggy Instamart gets 9 FSSAI notices over contaminated eggs & milk, spoilt 'Kakke da Paratha', other complaints"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/swiggy-fssai-prohibition-order-toing-app-licence-11783688463770.html", "headline": "Swiggy gets FSSAI order on its Toing app licence, rejigs details"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/companies/swiggy-clears-the-air-on-fssai-prohibition-order-against-toing-cites-licence-update-not-food-safety-concerns-11783684895744.h